-- The other half of the words: the daily tasks and the report pieces.
--
-- These two were already rows, pushed over /admin/content. They are written
-- here once for the same reason the rest of the content was: a database built
-- from these migrations has to be one somebody can use, and until now a fresh
-- one came up with eighteen archetypes and nothing for any of them to do.
--
-- Guarded by ON CONFLICT, so running it where they already exist changes
-- nothing. From here they are edited through /admin/content like every other
-- word.

ON CONFLICT (day, archetype_id, ordinal) DO NOTHING;

ON CONFLICT (kind, archetype_id, dimension, band, section) DO NOTHING;
